WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
Wang Teng

2
00:00:01,120 --> 00:00:03,280
You stepped on the bones of Yanmen soldiers

3
00:00:03,280 --> 00:00:05,720
Climbed to the position of generalissimo of the world's soldiers and horses

4
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:07,280
It's time to pay back today

5
00:00:07,280 --> 00:00:08,320
old man

6
00:00:08,320 --> 00:00:09,840
You think you can kill me

7
00:00:16,740 --> 00:00:21,480
This shot is for brothers who are not generals.

8
00:00:21,840 --> 00:00:26,800
I'm done with the general, the general.

9
00:00:30,910 --> 00:00:46,980
It's time to meet the two non-general marshals. This is a dead end.

10
00:00:47,380 --> 00:00:50,960
Did we go in the wrong direction? That's right.

11
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:52,400
I'm a debt collector

12
00:00:53,140 --> 00:01:10,500
I don’t need you to protect my father and grandfather Xuan’er.

13
00:01:11,160 --> 00:01:12,600
Father regards you as king

14
00:01:12,880 --> 00:01:15,520
I think this is the lord of the world

15
00:01:16,530 --> 00:01:19,450
I'm here to say goodbye to my son. I'm not here. Xuan'er

16
00:01:19,450 --> 00:01:22,130
The position of Southern King in this array is yours. If you want it,

17
00:01:22,130 --> 00:01:23,850
You can take it back to dad at any time

18
00:01:24,210 --> 00:01:25,210
What I want

19
00:01:25,210 --> 00:01:26,370
never like this

20
00:01:27,030 --> 00:01:28,150
everything i do

21
00:01:28,470 --> 00:01:30,190
Just to give myself an explanation

22
00:01:30,770 --> 00:01:32,210
It’s also about personal grudges

23
00:01:32,630 --> 00:01:33,910
A full stop
